<pre class='metadata'>
Title: `vector<bool>` as an underlying container in flat adaptors
Shortname: D????
Level: 1
Status: D
Group: WG21
Audience: LEWG
URL: https://cppproposals.aryan.app/flatbool.html
Editor: Aryan Naraghi, aryan.naraghi@gmail.com
Abstract:
  Allow `vector<bool>` as an underlying container in `flat_map`, `flat_multimap`, `flat_set`, and `flat_multiset`, enabling `bool` as a key or mapped type with the default template arguments.
Complain About: accidental-2119 yes, missing-example-ids yes
Default Highlight: c++
