Implementation Experience {#impl}
=================================

The proposed wording has been implemented in libc++ on the [`flatbool`
branch in github.com/aryann/llvm-project](https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/compare/main...aryann:llvm-project:flatbool).
The existing flat adaptors test suite passes against it. A new
`bool.pass.cpp` test for each of the four flat adaptors exercises
`vector<bool>` as an underlying container.

